      "html_url": "https://github.com/pvvtechnologiest/ORACLE-ICS-Course-Online-Training",
      "description": "PvvTechnologies will provide ISTQB Course Online Training Course. candidates the essential knowledge for getting foundation on networking which will be mostly helpful for entry level network engineers. This online training focuses on imparting the participants with practical and real time project driven knowledge by networking solutions experts. ORACLE ICS With the help of a certification course in ORACLE ICS, you can easily perform some basic mapping and integration between cloud applications. It is also known as a powerful integration platform to enhance the value of your investments in SaaS. Course Highlights: By taking up this certification course, you would be able to learn: • OIC Architecture • Basic Workflow • Provisioning and setting up OIC Instance • Pre-packaged Components • Adapters and Connections • Configuring SOAP Adapter • Connection Properties • Activating and Testing Integrations   To attend free Demo session call me @ +91 8790679998. whats app 91 7702529995 www.pvvtechnologies.com  contact@pvvtechnologies.com",
